        {"zh": "这么一小块，也值得我离窝。", "en": "A morsel this small, worth leaving my nest?"},
        {"zh": "你退开我再吃", "en": "Step back, then I will eat."},
        {"zh": "我一边吃一边看窝", "en": "I eat while watching the nest."},
        {"zh": "还有吗", "en": "Is there more?"},
        {"zh": "味道还行", "en": "That tastes acceptable."},
        {"zh": "我不离开窝太远", "en": "I do not go far from the nest."}
